  "comment": "CsCode's tree-sitter bundle: every download pinned (docs/TREE-SITTER.md). Grammar revisions are the ones nvim-treesitter pins at the commit in 'queries' (lua/nvim-treesitter/parsers.lua), so grammars and queries match. fetch-grammars.sh downloads and verifies every source; build-grammars.sh compiles the runtime and the grammars and writes the bundle the app ships. sha256/size: the GitHub source archive (.tar.gz) of 'commit'; the commit id is also checked against the archive's pax header.",
